      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku za utawala wa Daudi kpwakala na ndzala muda wa miaka mihahu mfululizo. Ndipho Daudi achimvoya Mwenyezi Mlungu, naye Mwenyezi Mlungu achiamba, “Sauli na atu a nyumbaye ana kosa ra kumwaga milatso kpwa kuolaga baazi ya Agibioni.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.9.3+JOS.9.4+JOS.9.5+JOS.9.6+JOS.9.7+JOS.9.8+JOS.9.9+JOS.9.10+JOS.9.11+JOS.9.12+JOS.9.13+JOS.9.14+JOS.9.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Joshuwa 9:3–15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho mfalume achiaiha Agibioni achigomba nao. (Agibioni sio Aiziraeli, ela kala ni Aamori ariosazwa. Dzagbwe Aiziraeli kala akahenda mapatano nao, Sauli walonda kuaolaga osi katika juhudize za kuendeleza atu a Iziraeli na a Juda.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Daudi achiauza hinyo Agibioni, “Mnalonda nikuhendereni utu wani? Nawezadze kureha upatanisho, ili mubariki atu a Mwenyezi Mlungu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hinyo Agibioni achimjibu achiamba, “Dzambo kahi yehu na nyumba ya Sauli tarindariphiwa kpwa feza wala zahabu wala swino tahuna haki ya kuolaga mutu yeyesi wa Iziraeli.” Mfalume achiauza, “Pho vino munaniamba nikuhendereni utu wani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao achimjibu mfalume achiamba, “Yuya mutu ariyelonda kuhuangamiza ili husikalepho kpwenye tsi ya Iziraeli ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "phahi, nahureherwe alume sabaa kula chivyazi cha Sauli, naswi huaolage na huatsundike dzulu za mihi mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu hiko Gibeya, mudzi arikola Sauli, ariyetsambulwa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu.” Mfalume achiamba, “Nindakuphani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
