            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.20.15+1SA.20.16+1SA.20.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Samueli 20:15–17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.1+2SA.9.2+2SA.9.3+2SA.9.4+2SA.9.5+2SA.9.6+2SA.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Samueli 9:1–7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela mfalume achimuonera mbazi Mefiboshethi mwana wa Jonathani, mdzukulu wa Sauli, kpwa ajili ya chirapho cha Mwenyezi Mlungu chirichokala kahi ya Daudi na Jonathani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.18.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Samueli 18:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalume waahala Arimoni na Mefiboshethi, ana airi a Risipa mwana mchetu wa Aya ambao waavyala na Sauli, na ana atsano a Merabu mwana mchetu wa Sauli ambao waavyala na Adirieli, mwana wa Barizilai kula mudzi wa Mehola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achialavya kpwa Agibioni, nao achiaolaga na achiatsundika mihini mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu hiko mwangoni. Osi sabaa aolagbwa chivyamwenga siku za kpwandza-kpwandza za mwandzo wa mavuno ga shayiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Risipa mwana mchetu wa Aya achihala gunia achirihumira kudzitengezera utu dza chibanda maweni, achikala phapho hangu mwandzo wa mavuno hadi mvula iriphopiga hira miri. Naye kayaricha nyama a mapha kutsota miri iyo mutsi wala nyama a tsakani kurya iyo miri usiku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ariphosikira gara garigohendwa ni Risipa mwana wa Aya, mwanachetu wa Sauli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.31.8+1SA.31.9+1SA.31.10+1SA.31.11+1SA.31.12+1SA.31.13"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Samueli 31:8–13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wakpwendahala mifupha ya Sauli na ya mwanawe Jonathani kula kpwa atu a Jabeshi-Giliadi. Atu hinyo kala akaihala chisiri kula uwanja wa Bethi-Shani, hipho Afilisti ariphoatsundika, siku ariyomturya Sauli hiko Giliboa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi waireha iyo mifupha ya Sauli na ya mwanawe Jonathani, piya wakpwendazola-zola iyo mifupha ya hinyo ariosongolwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha iyo mifupha yazikpwa phamwenga na ya Sauli na ya mwanawe Jonathani mbirani mwa Kishi, ise wa Sauli hiko Sela, kpwenye tsi ya Benjamini. Aho ahenda gosi arigoamuru mfalume, na badaye Mlungu wasikira mavoyo gao garigohusu yo tsi yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwakala na viha tsona kahi ya Afilisti na Aiziraeli. Daudi na atumishie atserera kpwendapigana na Afilisti, naye Daudi wasirirwa ni nguvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishibi-Benobu mutu ariyekala mmwengawapho wa chivyazi cha Arafa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21:16",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Atu a chivyazi cha Arafa kala ni madzitu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yekala na fumo ra shaba rokala na uziho wa kilo tahu na nusu, na kala akadzifunga upanga muphya, naye wajeza kumuolaga Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.11.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Afalume 11:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.132.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zaburi 132:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Abishai mwana wa Seruya, achimtivya, achimpiga iye Mfilisti achimuolaga. Ndipho atu a Daudi achimuapira achiamba, “Uwe kundaphiya tsona phamwenga naswi vihani sedze ukaizima taa ya utawala wa Iziraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya gaga, kpwakala na viha tsona na Afilisti ko Gobu, ndipho Sibekai kula mudzi wa Husha wamuolaga Safu, ariyekala mmwengawapho wa Arafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwakala na viha tsona na Afilisti ko Gobu, na Elihanani mwana wa Jairi kula Bethilehemu, achimuolaga Lahimi, mwanao wa Goliathi kula Gathi ambaye mphini wa fumore wakala dza muhi wa mfumadzi wa nguwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwakala na viha vyanjina ko Gathi, kurikokala na dzitu kulu ambaro kala rina mala sita chila mkpwono na mala sita chila gulu, jumula ya mala mirongo miiri na ne. Iye naye wakala wa chivyazi cha Arafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye hiye aripholaphiza Aiziraeli, Jonathani mwana Shimea, mwanao wa Daudi achimuolaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
